{"ID":"20260206192147-45jp7aq","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"icon":"1f383","id":"20260206192147-45jp7aq","tags":"CNN,神经网络基础学习,经典卷积神经网络架构","title":"VGGNet","type":"doc","updated":"20260206192257"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206192228-34m3uaz","Type":"NodeCallout","Properties":{"id":"20260206192228-34m3uaz","updated":"20260206192228"},"CalloutType":"NOTE","CalloutTitle":"Note","CalloutIcon":"✏️","Children":[{"ID":"20260206192215-9zgwldd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192215-9zgwldd","updated":"20260206192228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"VGGNet"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"Karen Simonyan"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等人在ImageNet大赛上获奖并于2015年在论文"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"VERY DEEP CONVOLUTIONAL NETWORKS FOR LARGE-SCALE IMAGE RECOGNITION"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中提出的网络架构。"}]},{"ID":"20260206192215-fed4hue","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192215-fed4hue","updated":"20260206192228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个网络结构主要是用于大规模图像识别的一种极深的卷积神经网络。是当时最最最深的神经网络结构，同时也是计算量最大的一种网络结构。"}]},{"ID":"20260206192215-qlw0z6k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192215-qlw0z6k","updated":"20260206192228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我认为就是该网络引领了后面大家向着更多深度的网络迈进，也是深度方面的鼻祖性神经网络结构。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206192215-81p8z6e","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260206192215-81p8z6e","updated":"20260206192233"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1 模型背景"}]},{"ID":"20260206192215-5lmymp4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192215-5lmymp4","updated":"20260206192215"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在该模型提出的早期有一个颠覆性的神经网络模型"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"AlexNet"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"产出来了，当时基本上所有的网络都是在对"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"AlexNet"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"架构进行改进，当然"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"VGGNet"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"也是如此。"}]},{"ID":"20260206192215-kj887di","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192215-kj887di","updated":"20260206192215"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在VGGNet产生之前，有许多的学者在AlexNet的基础上采用卷积层更小的核心以及更小的步幅获得了非常好的效果；还有一些人是对整个网络的模型结构上深度也获得了不错的改进。"}]},{"ID":"20260206192215-b0dbx0b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192215-b0dbx0b","updated":"20260206192215"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那么这两种方法都可行的话，可以不可以将他们二者合二为一呢，搞一个卷积核很小并且深度特别深的网络结构呢？当然"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"VGGNet"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"也就孕育而生了。"}]},{"ID":"20260206192215-isdjo7o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192215-isdjo7o","updated":"20260206192233"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"VGGNet"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"网络结构是非常的简单的，他的整体都采用很小的卷积核对每一层都是特别小的那种卷积核，并且每一层卷积的卷积核完全相同。此外猛拉网络深度，达到了惊人的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"16-19"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"层。"}]},{"ID":"20260206192233-g03r450","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192233-g03r450","updated":"20260206192233"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20260206192233-pno41fv.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260206192215-9k5vapb","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260206192215-9k5vapb","updated":"20260206192215"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20260206192215-y4fnt2a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192215-y4fnt2a","updated":"20260206192215"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不要认为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"16-19"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"层非常的浅，实际上这个深度是很深很深的，哪怕是16层的网络结构他的参数也已经达到了惊人的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"1330000000一亿三千三百万"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"！"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206192215-xracerv","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260206192215-xracerv","updated":"20260206192241"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2 模型架构"}]},{"ID":"20260206192215-i1b0lxy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192215-i1b0lxy","updated":"20260206192215"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"VGGNet"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"总共有六种网络结构分别命名为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"A，ALRn，B，C，D，E"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，网络的深度从左到右逐级递增。最后一种结构的深度为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"19"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"层。"}]},{"ID":"20260206192215-lmdm864","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192215-lmdm864","updated":"20260206192215"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"VGGNet整体采用3"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\\"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"times 3大小的卷积核进行每一次卷积操作，同时卷积的步长"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"Stride=1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，卷积过程中的填充"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"Padding=1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。对于这个数据我们稍微做一下计算。"}]},{"ID":"20260206192215-kz5f3dg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192215-kz5f3dg","updated":"20260206192215"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"假设输入的图片大小为H"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\\"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"times W，卷积核的大小为K"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\\"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"times K，卷积过程中的步长Stride"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"="}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"S，卷积过程中的填充Padding"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"="}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"P，输出的图片大小为H'"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\\"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"times W'。"}]},{"ID":"20260206192215-04390m7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192215-04390m7","updated":"20260206192215"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那么就有H' "},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"="}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\\"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"frac{H+2P-K}{2} +1 ; W' "},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"="}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\\"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"frac{W+2P-K}{2}。将数据带入就有H' "},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"="}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\\"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"frac{H+2-1}{2} +1"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"="}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"H ; W' "},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"="}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\\"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"frac{W+2-1}{2}"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"="}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"W。发现卷积前后的图片尺寸并无变化。"}]},{"ID":"20260206192215-wrmuq4u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192215-wrmuq4u","updated":"20260206192215"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"VGG"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"网络中卷积后的下一步操作是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"ReLU"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个就是一种激活函数。"}]},{"ID":"20260206192215-qu11c9a","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260206192215-qu11c9a","updated":"20260206192215"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20260206192215-d2d9tpm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192215-d2d9tpm","updated":"20260206192215"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"AlexNet"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中已经有过介绍了"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206192215-eg74ae1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192215-eg74ae1","updated":"20260206192215"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"最后一步就是最大池化，并且池化的参数也是固定的参数，一般是令池化的核心数量为2"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\\"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"times 2，池化的步长为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"2"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这么一来每次池化后的大小均是原来图像大小的一半。"}]},{"ID":"20260206192215-xy8skcy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192215-xy8skcy","updated":"20260206192215"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"VGGNet就是这样子一块一块的叠加，每一块都是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"Conv+ReLU+MaxPool"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的集合。我们将这个集合称为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"VGG块"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，每次图片经过"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"VGG块"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"之后他的图像尺寸就会缩小一倍，也就是长宽各变成原来的一半大小，那么如此有规律的运作就使得我们在进行深度叠加的时候变得更加的简洁。"}]},{"ID":"20260206192215-apc4hot","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260206192215-apc4hot","updated":"20260206192215"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20260206192215-nazf3ux","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192215-nazf3ux","updated":"20260206192215"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个块儿的思路我觉得是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"VGG"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"网络最大的创新点"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206192215-b8bhlzg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192215-b8bhlzg","updated":"20260206192215"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"现在就给出原文的具体的六种网络结构。"}]},{"ID":"20260206192240-d88yesg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192240-d88yesg","updated":"20260206192241"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20260206192241-1gwb1v0.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260206192215-de0jnz8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192215-de0jnz8","updated":"20260206192215"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"他的每一列都是一种类型的网络。"}]},{"ID":"20260206192215-ab9aoaf","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260206192215-ab9aoaf","updated":"20260206192257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3 模型代码框架"}]},{"ID":"20260206192215-9h6apsb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192215-9h6apsb","updated":"20260206192215"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这里以"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"VGG"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"-A网络结构为重要的例子进行阐述，下面是VGG-A的整体结构图。应该是比较清晰的"}]},{"ID":"20260206192246-y5k0er5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192246-y5k0er5","updated":"20260206192247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20260206192247-q21685u.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260206192215-a2202zj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192215-a2202zj","updated":"20260206192215"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"然后给出"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"VGG-A"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的代码"}]},{"ID":"20260206192215-8t0ndrg","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260206192215-8t0ndrg","updated":"20260206192255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"cHl0aG9u"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":" import torch\n import torch.nn as nn\n ​\n class VGGNetA(nn.Module):\n     '''VGGNetA模型定义\n     '''\n     def __init__(self , num_classes = 10):\n         super(VGGNetA , self).__init__()\n         # input size = [3 , 224 , 224]\n         self.conv1 = nn.Conv2d(3 , 64 , kernel_size = 3 , padding= 1)\n         self.relu1 = nn.ReLU()\n         self.maxpool1 = nn.MaxPool2d(kernel_size=2 , stride=2)\n ​\n         # input size = [64 , 112 , 112]\n         self.conv2 = nn.Conv2d(64 , 128 , kernel_size = 3 , padding= 1)\n         self.relu2 = nn.ReLU()\n         self.maxpool2 = nn.MaxPool2d(kernel_size=2 , stride=2)\n ​\n         # input size = [128 , 56 , 56]\n         self.conv3 = nn.Conv2d(128 , 256 , kernel_size = 3 , padding= 1)\n         self.relu3 = nn.ReLU()\n         self.conv4 = nn.Conv2d(256 , 256 , kernel_size = 3 , padding= 1)\n         self.relu4 = nn.ReLU()\n         self.maxpool3 = nn.MaxPool2d(kernel_size=2 , stride=2)\n ​\n         # input size = [256 , 28 , 28]\n         self.conv5 = nn.Conv2d(256 , 512 , kernel_size = 3 , padding= 1)\n         self.relu5 = nn.ReLU()\n         self.conv6 = nn.Conv2d(512 , 512 , kernel_size = 3 , padding= 1)\n         self.relu6 = nn.ReLU()\n         self.maxpool4 = nn.MaxPool2d(kernel_size=2 , stride=2)  \n ​\n         # input size = [512 , 14 , 14]\n         self.conv7 = nn.Conv2d(512 , 512 , kernel_size = 3 , padding= 1)\n         self.relu7 = nn.ReLU()\n         self.conv8 = nn.Conv2d(512 , 512 , kernel_size = 3 , padding= 1)\n         self.relu8 = nn.ReLU()\n         self.maxpool5 = nn.MaxPool2d(kernel_size=2 , stride=2)\n ​\n         # input size = [512 , 7 , 7]\n         self.fc1 = nn.Linear(in_features=25088 ,out_features=4096 , bias=True)\n         self.relu9 = nn.ReLU()\n         \n         self.fc2 = nn.Linear(in_features=4096 , out_features=4096 , bias=True)\n         self.relu10 = nn.ReLU()\n ​\n         self.fc3 = nn.Linear(in_features=4096 , out_features=1000 , bias= True)\n     \n     def forward(self , x):\n         x = self.conv1(x)\n         x = self.relu1(x)\n         x = self.maxpool1(x)\n         x = self.conv2(x)\n         x = self.relu2(x)\n         x = self.maxpool2(x)\n         x = self.conv3(x)\n         x = self.relu3(x)\n         x = self.conv4(x)\n         x = self.relu4(x)\n         x = self.maxpool3(x)\n         x = self.conv5(x)\n         x = self.relu5(x)\n         x = self.conv6(x)\n         x = self.relu6(x)\n         x = self.maxpool4(x)\n         x = self.conv7(x)\n         x = self.relu7(x)\n         x = self.conv8(x)\n         x = self.relu8(x)\n         x = self.maxpool5(x)\n         x = x.view(x.size(0), -1)\n         x = self.fc1(x)\n         x = self.relu9(x)\n         x = self.fc2(x)\n         x = self.relu10(x)\n         x = self.fc3(x)\n         return x\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260206192257-rbvgcf8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192257-rbvgcf8","updated":"20260206192257"}}]}